5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Hello everyone. I am Daisuke. I am a bit nervous, but I will try my best to help us find the truth.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,Greetings. I am Victoria. I prefer to observe carefully before acting. Let us proceed with caution and logic.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Shunichi here. Don't worry, I'll keep the chaos in check. Let's not waste time on pleasantries.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm Takumi! I'm ready to fight. We need to be brave and not let fear stop us.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I am Ryuji. I will analyze the situation calmly. Emotion often leads to error, so let us rely on facts.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I agree with Ryuji. Facts are important. I don't want to make a mistake that hurts someone.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,Agreed. Rushing to judgment is dangerous. We must listen to everyone's statements and look for inconsistencies.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Exactly. Panic is the enemy. If you start shouting, I'll ignore you. Keep it logical, please.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,I don't like waiting around! But I'll listen. I just want to protect my friends from the wolves.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Protection is good, but blind action is worse. We need a strategy. Who do we trust first?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I think we should trust those who are calm. I feel safer when people are quiet and thoughtful.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"Calmness does not guarantee honesty, but it is a good starting point. I will watch for sudden changes in tone.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Calmness is just a mask, sometimes. But I'll give you a pass for now. Don't make me regret it.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"I trust my gut! If someone feels wrong, I'll say so. I won't let the wolves hide in plain sight.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,Intuition is unreliable. I prefer data. Let us see how the night plays out before making strong claims.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,Okay. I will try to be brave. I hope we can all work together to find the werewolf.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Victoria,,We will. I am ready to contribute my observations. Let us see who reveals themselves under pressure.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Fine. I'm ready. Let's see who blinks first. I'm not the one who will, that's for sure.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready to go! Let's do this! I won't give up until we win.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will remain objective. Let the evidence speak. I am ready for the next phase of the game.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
