31,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I have information. I checked Shunichi. He is human. I am not sure if I should say more.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"Interesting. Daisuke claims to be the Seer. Shunichi, how do you respond to this claim?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Huh? You checked me? Well, I am human, so you're right. But why target me first? Suspicious.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Daisuke! You're brave for speaking up! I trust you! Shunichi, you better not be lying!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"A bold claim. If Daisuke is the Seer, his information is valuable. If he is lying, he is a wolf.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I am telling the truth. I am scared, but I want to help. Please believe me. I checked Shunichi.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Fear is a common reaction, but it can also be a performance. I will keep this in mind. Shunichi, your reaction was quick.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Quick? I'm just efficient. If I were the wolf, I'd let you all talk yourselves into a corner. I'm not.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I don't care about efficiency! I care about honesty! Daisuke, I'm with you! We need to find the real wolf!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Takumi's loyalty is noted. However, blind trust is a weakness. We must verify Daisuke's claim further.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I don't know how to prove it. I just know what I saw. I hope you can trust my word.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"Trust is earned through consistency. I will observe your future actions. Shunichi, your defense was adequate, but not perfect.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Adequate is all I need. You're overthinking it, Victoria. Just look at the facts. I'm human. Daisuke says so.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Takumi,,Facts! Yes! Daisuke is the Seer! I can feel it! We should vote for anyone who acts shady!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Takumi, your enthusiasm is misplaced. We have no proof Daisuke is the Seer. He could be a Possessed.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I am not a Possessed. I am a Seer. I want to save us. Please, don't vote for me.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will not vote for you yet. I need more information. The game is young. Let us see who else speaks.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,See? Even Victoria is hesitant. Don't let Takumi's noise cloud your judgment. Stay calm. Stay smart.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not noisy! I'm passionate! I trust Daisuke! If you don't, you're the wolf! I'm serious!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"Takumi, your accusation is baseless. I will not be swayed by emotion. I will wait for the vote to see the dynamics.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
