64,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,Takumi is gone. I am sad. I checked Victoria. She is human. I am still the Seer.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"Daisuke, you claim I am human. I appreciate the information, but I remain cautious. Shunichi, your vote for Takumi was interesting.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,Interesting? I voted for the loudest idiot in the room. It was a strategic move to reduce noise. You're welcome.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Shunichi, your logic is flawed. Takumi was not a threat. You have now revealed your willingness to eliminate allies.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I didn't mean to cause trouble. I just wanted to help. I am sorry Takumi is gone. I feel bad.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"Your apology is noted. However, actions speak louder than words. I will continue to observe. Shunichi, explain your strategy.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,My strategy is to win. I voted for Takumi because he was a liability. He was too emotional. I'm not sorry.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,A liability? He was a potential ally. You have isolated yourself. I am beginning to see a pattern in your behavior.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I don't want to fight. I just want to find the wolf. I checked Victoria, and she is safe. Please trust me.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"I trust the process, not individuals. Daisuke, your consistency is a plus. Shunichi, your aggression is a minus.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,Aggression is just confidence. You're just scared because I'm right. I'm not the wolf. Daisuke says I'm human.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,Daisuke's word is not absolute. He could be lying to protect a wolf. I need to see more evidence before I trust anyone.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I am telling the truth. I am the Seer. I want to win. I hope we can work together. I am scared of losing.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"Fear is understandable. I will not judge you for it. I will focus on the facts. Shunichi, your defense is weak.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Weak? It's honest. You're the one hiding behind ""facts."" Just admit you're scared of me. I'm not the wolf.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I am not hiding. I am analyzing. Shunichi, your defensiveness is a red flag. I will keep you in mind for the vote.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
