92,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Shunichi is gone. I am sad. I checked Ryuji. He is a werewolf. I am the Seer. Please believe me.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
93,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"Daisuke, you claim Ryuji is a werewolf. This is a significant accusation. Ryuji, how do you respond?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
94,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"A bold claim. Daisuke, you have been consistent, but consistency does not equal truth. I am a villager.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
95,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I am telling the truth. I am scared, but I know what I saw. Ryuji is the wolf. Please, vote for him.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
96,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"I will consider this. However, I must be certain. Daisuke, why did you not reveal this earlier?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
97,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,I did not reveal it because I was waiting for the right moment. I am not the wolf. Daisuke is lying.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
98,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I am not lying. I am the Seer. I want to save us. I am sorry I didn't say it sooner. I was afraid.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
99,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"Fear is a common excuse. I will not be swayed by it. I will vote based on the evidence. Daisuke, your evidence is your word.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
100,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,My word is that I am not the wolf. Daisuke is trying to manipulate you. I am a villager. I have nothing to hide.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
101,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I am telling the truth. I am the Seer. I want to win. I hope you can trust me. I am scared of losing.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
102,3,4,talk,Victoria,,"I will not trust you blindly. I will vote for Ryuji. If you are the Seer, this is the right move. If not, you have made a mistake.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
